{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foreverthorn</strong> is a short game about facing your grief after the death of your wife. It will take you deep into the dungeons of Rose Chapel to <strong>find roses for her grave.</strong> <br> <br><strong>Explore</strong> the dungeons, use your <strong>shotgun</strong> to blast enemies out of the way, <strong>avoid deadly traps</strong> and find other items that will help you on the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon environment with multiple levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and eerie atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D pixelated graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person shooter character controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-assignable keybinds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime of about 2 hours</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918930?t=1758062346","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/7fd9260623628c66aa0032f2dfaa845f893c4145/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758062346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/2dec837e5f1d37c26a5fbbacd1aeda27fa702103/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758062346","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918930/2dec837e5f1d37c26a5fbbacd1aeda27fa702103/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758062346","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game includes blood and themes like death and grief, which may be unpleasant to some players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foreverthorn</strong> is a short game about facing your grief after the death of your wife. It will take you deep int